{"id":"en_possessed-priest","title":"Possessed Priest","titleEn":"Possessed Priest","description":"Noah serves as a priest in a temple, where his brother Ken subjects him to torture in an attempt to cleanse what Ken calls his impurity. Noah escapes and finds refuge with Lucas, a fallen angel who rules the abyss. Lucas takes possession of Noah, leaves his mark on him, and will not release him. Yet Noah is no passive victim; he carries the Holy Grail within him, which makes him a target pursued by both heaven and hell. While Ken fights to take him back, Noah faces a decision: give himself over to the abyss that offered him safety, or turn the tables and become a hunter no one anticipated.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/possessed-priest/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/possessed-priest/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Fantasy","Romance","Love Triangle","Tangled love","LGBTQ+","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsg0c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_possessed-priest_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsg0c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_possessed-priest_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsg0c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_possessed-priest_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsg0c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_possessed-priest_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/